Usage of benchmark:
  -dir string
    	new private benchmark directory
  -endpoint string
    	explicit numeric loopback Ollama endpoint for scale mode
  -max-output-tokens int
    	scale Ollama per-generation token cap (1..512) (default 32)
  -mode string
    	scale workload: mock or ollama (local model calls) (default "mock")
  -model string
    	already installed Ollama model tag for scale mode
  -model-digest string
    	pinned local model digest for scale mode
  -runs int
    	repetitions per serial/parallel arm (1..10) (default 2)
  -tasks int
    	scale workload task count (1..10000); omitted keeps the five-task offline comparison
  -timeout duration
    	scale per-task execution timeout (default 30s)
  -workers int
    	scale workload worker slots (1..128) (default 6)
